WEBVTT

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:05.980
Our first deployment went well, but

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:07.900
that’s all you could say about it.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:13.700
Even though we train every day,
I haven’t had much time to get stronger.

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:17.370
In my hands is a partner who is too good for me,

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:23.210
and the only people around me are
either geniuses or heroes with long service records.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:28.540
Now I can’t help but ask myself, “Why am I here?”

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:33.470
Why did she choose me to be her subordinate?

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:38.940
Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha StrikerS<i>
will now begin.</i>

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:37.970
Now then, I’ll go over the events leading up to now, as well as today’s mission.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:41.200
The mysterious creator of the Gadget Drones,

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:44.910
as well as the person collecting Relics, is currently believed to be this man.

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:50.840
He’s an interdimensional criminal with
a wide-area arrest warrant for his illegal research.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:54.340
We’ll conduct our investigation around Jail Scaglietti.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:03:00.280
Even though I’m the primary investigator in our unit,
I still want everyone to take note of him.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.450
Yes, ma’am!

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:06.620
So today we’re heading here, Hotel Augusta!

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:10.950
We’ll be guarding an antiques auction as well as securing the premises.

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:12.790
That’s today’s mission, okay?

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:17.210
Due to the trade of legal Lost Logia,

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:22.270
there’s a good chance their presence
may attract Gadget Drones mistaking them for Relics.

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:25.600
For that reason, we were called in as security for today.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.880
With a large auction such as this one,

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:31.300
there may be some secret deals
and smuggling involved in the shadows,

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:33.440
so make sure you don’t let your guard down.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:41.240
Since last night, Lt. Signum and Lt. Vita, as well as a number of operatives, have been at the scene.

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:44.660
We will handle the security within the building,

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:48.460
so you front-line troops should act in accordance with the lieutenants’ instructions, okay?

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:49.120
Yes, ma’am!

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:52.070
Er... Dr. Shamal?

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:55.540
I’ve been wondering for a while now... what’s in that box?

00:03:57.990 --> 00:03:59.030
This?

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:02.720
They’re the captains’ “work clothes.”

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:15.300
It’s a pleasure to have you.

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:16.280
Welcome.

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:23.680
Good afternoon, we’re from Riot Force 6.

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:32.530
The assembly hall’s security is as tight as you’d expect.

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:36.410
If there’s any general trouble,
they’re probably enough to deal with it, I suppose.

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:39.000
Riot Force 6’s youngsters are fortifying the outside,

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.470
and there are also emergency shutters around the premises.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:46.390
It doesn’t seem like the Gadgets would be able to make it in this far.

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:50.060
We can’t be complacent, but that’s a relief.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:55.540
Well, whatever happens, we won’t get our turn unless there’s a real emergency.

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:01.230
How long until the auction starts?

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.970
Three hours and 27 minutes.

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:08.980
Is that...?

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:11.750
Doc, is something wrong?

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:13.400
Uh... no.

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:19.340
But today, Commander Yagami
has gathered all her guardian knights.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:22.800
It seems so. You seem pretty well-informed about them.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:26.220
Commander Yagami and the lieutenants, that is.

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:30.180
I’ve heard things from Dad and Ginny, though.

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:34.370
The Device Commander Yagami uses is a tome-type,

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:37.600
and they said its name is the Book of the Night Sky.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:41.060
The lieutenants, Dr. Shamal, and Zafira are

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:45.990
Commander Yagami’s personal special forces from what I’ve heard.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:52.410
And if you include Command Sergeant Major Rein, the six of them make an invincible force in battle.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:58.680
Well, specific information about the capabilities of Commander Yagami and the others is top secret,

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:00.840
so I don’t know all the details either, but...

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:04.310
It seems like everyone has Rare Skills, right?

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:06.520
Tia, is something
bothering you?

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:07.640
Not really.

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:09.630
I see.
Well, see you later then.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:16.770
Riot Force 6’s combat strength is more than just “invincible”: it’s utterly abnormal.

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:21.450
I don’t know what trick Commander Yagami used, but

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:26.000
the captains are all S+ rank,
and even the lieutenants are at least AA rank.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:30.910
All of the other soldiers,
from the front-line troops to the control operators,

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:32.990
are nothing but future elites.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:36.690
Then there’s Erio, who’s already B rank,

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:39.300
and Caro, who’s a rare and powerful dragon summoner...

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:41.710
Both of them are Fate’s protégés.

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:46.730
Though Subaru may be dangerous at times, she’s full of potential and latent talent,

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:49.630
and she has a kind family backing her up.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:54.100
I knew it! The only average person in our unit is me.

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:58.120
But that doesn’t matter.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:01.520
I can’t let that stop me.

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:08.400
So that’s the place.

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:11.820
The thing you’re looking for, it’s not here, is it?

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:15.700
Is something bothering you?

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:28.920
The Doctor’s toys seem to be getting closer.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:40.310
Klarwind’s sensor is reacting.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:40.940
Shari!

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:41.980
Right!

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:45.660
They’re coming! They’re here!

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:49.200
Gadget Drones: Type 1 land models sighted, 30... 35!

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:51.360
Type 3 land models, 2... 3... 4!

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:54.320
Erio, Caro, head back up.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:58.120
Teana’s team will create
the defensive line in front of the hotel.

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:58.740
Yes, ma’am!

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:01.410
Zafira will go and intercept them with me.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.780
Understood.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.240
Zafira, you can talk?

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:06.240
You scared me!

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:09.980
The center of our defensive net will be you guys.
We’re counting on you.

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:11.760
U-Understood!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:12.840
I’ll do my best.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.950
All front-line troops,

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:16.760
we’re using a wide-area defensive setup,

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:19.960
together with Long Arch 1’s general surveillance.

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:23.190
I, Shamal, will take command of the scene.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.650
Stars 3, roger!

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:28.110
Lightning F, roger!

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:30.590
Stars 4, roger!

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:46.070
Dr. Shamal, I’d like to see the situation as well.

00:08:46.070 --> 00:08:48.170
Can you let me look at the front-line monitors?

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:51.160
Roger, I’ll connect Cross Mirage to the monitors.

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:53.730
Klarwind, can you please?

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:54.440
Yes.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:06.730
Signum, Vita?

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:10.900
Stars 2 and Lightning 2, heading out!

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.850
Device locks released.

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:16.840
Graf Eisen, Lævateinn, approved for level 2 maneuvers.

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:18.510
Graf Eisen!

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:20.160
Lævateinn!

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:21.550
Start up.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:56.350
We can’t let any units make it to the newbies’ defensive line.
We’ll smash them to bits there.

00:09:56.850 --> 00:09:59.340
You’re surprisingly protective.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:00.740
Shut up!

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:09.080
Fate, what did the chairman say?

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:11.690
We’ve told him about the situation outside,

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:14.550
but evacuating and interrupting the auction would be a problem.

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:17.810
They’ll delay the opening a bit
and see how things are from there.

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:19.010
I see.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:25.710
I’ll smash the big one.

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:27.940
Can you take the small ones?

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:28.700
Of course.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.280
Let’s go, Eisen!

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:32.340
Roger!

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:39.950
Smash them all

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:45.220
to pieces!

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.420
Lævateinn.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:03.860
Explosion

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:09.730
<b>Glittering...</b>

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:13.540
<b>...Swordflash</b>

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:25.870
You shall not pass!

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:01.900
The lieutenants and Zafira... they’re amazing!

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:05.320
This is with an ability limiter?

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:15.240
Good day, Knight Zest, Lutecia.

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:16.830
Good day.

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:17.880
What do you want?

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:21.840
How cold! You’re watching
the situation from nearby, aren’t you?

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:24.960
It doesn’t seem like a Relic is at that hotel,

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:30.100
but there is one thing that is
of great interest to my experiments.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:32.830
I don’t suppose I could ask for your cooperation for a little while?

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:37.730
For you, it’s really something very simple, but...

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:39.200
I refuse.

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:43.650
As long as it doesn’t concern a Relic,
we agreed to not get involved with each other.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:45.540
How about you, Lutecia?

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:48.080
May I ask you to do this for me?

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.040
Fine.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:52.490
You’re so kind.

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:53.740
Thanks.

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:56.960
This time for certain, I’ll treat you to tea and treats.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:13:00.060
I’ve sent your Device, Asclepius,

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:03.830
the data on what I want.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.850
Well, good day, Doctor.

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:11.300
Indeed, good day.

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:13.810
I’ll be waiting for the good news.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:17.660
Are you sure?

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:21.890
Zest, although you and Agito hate the Doctor,

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:25.110
I don’t dislike him that much.

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:26.780
I see.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.900
What I seek...

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:44.090
Caro, what’s wrong?

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:47.550
Someone’s using a summoning spell nearby.

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:50.480
Klarwind’s sensor also reacted to it.

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:52.650
But this mana signautre...

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.390
I-It’s big!

00:13:56.870 --> 00:14:03.070
O small ones, ones that flap their wings,
answer my words, and heed my command.

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:04.750
Summoning

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:06.700
<b>Insect Platoon</b>

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.950
Mission: object control.

00:14:14.530 --> 00:14:16.960
Have a nice trip. Be careful, okay?

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:35.290
W-What the...?

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:43.690
What?

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.730
They’re suddenly moving better.

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:00.830
Those aren’t the movements of automated machines.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:03.500
They completely changed their allies’ abilities!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:06.420
Is it that summoner’s magic from before?

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:09.410
Vita, fall back to the defensive line.

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:14.610
If that summoner is over there,
the new recruits might be in danger.

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:16.300
U-Understood.

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:19.550
Zafira, meet up
with Signum.

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:21.150
Understood.

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:23.850
It’s as amazing as I thought...

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:25.620
That girl’s power.

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:31.570
Control of autonomic machines with
her small summons, “object controllers.”

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:36.240
That’s only a tiny fragment of her power.

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:40.610
Matter translocation: eleven objects.

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:41.690
Teleport.

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:43.360
Incoming summon!

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:44.130
It’s coming!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:49.560
Is that...

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:51.210
...a summoning circle?

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:53.610
Summoning can even do things like this?

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:58.470
A great summoner can also be a master of teleportation magic.

00:15:59.990 --> 00:16:02.690
What does it matter? Let’s go and intercept them!

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:04.100
Let’s do it!

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:07.990
It’s the same as it has been up until now.
It’ll be okay if I can show results.

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:12.710
I’ll prove my skill and bravery,

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:15.450
just like I’ve always done before.

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:22.040
Such a powerful summoner!

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:25.780
Even if I can’t defeat them myself, at least I need to see who they are.

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:39.690
Silver-colored bugs?

00:16:40.090 --> 00:16:41.830
Command Sergeant
Major Rein,

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:43.340
lots of those bugs are
appearing from

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:45.230
the direction
of the summoner.

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:47.430
It’s dangerous for you
to go alone.

00:16:47.430 --> 00:16:50.060
Evade them and join up
with the new recruits.

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:51.140
Okie-doke!

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:03.540
I’ve found what the Doctor was looking for.

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:07.600
Galue, could you do me a little favor?

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:11.920
The children in our way are being distracted by the Insects.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.900
Use this chance to secure the object.

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:17.760
Be careful.

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:29.740
Barret F.

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:33.380
Tia!

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:46.400
Defensive line, hold out
for a bit longer, okay?

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:47.360
Yes, ma’am!

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:49.880
Lt. Vita will be back soon!

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:53.080
Just defending won’t solve anything.

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:54.980
I’ll be sure to take them out!

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:57.010
Wai—Teana, are you okay?

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.080
Don’t do anything rash!

00:17:58.080 --> 00:17:59.960
Psh. I’m fine.

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:02.850
This is why I’ve been practicing every day: morning, noon, and night.

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:05.450
Erio, fall back to the center.

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:07.550
Subaru and I will go two-top.

00:18:07.550 --> 00:18:08.520
O-Okay!

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.500
Subaru, Cross Shift A! Let’s go!

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:12.420
Right!

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:18.960
I’ll prove it.

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:27.650
Even without special talents
or impressive mana reserves,

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:30.730
even in a unit with first-class leadership,

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:33.380
no matter how dangerous the battle,

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:41.260
I, the Bullet of the Lansters,
will definitively strike down any enemy.

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:51.470
Teana, it’s reckless to load so many.

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:53.870
Both for you and for Cross Mirage!

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:54.840
I’ll be able to fire.

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:56.280
Yes.

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.720
<b>Crossfire...</b>

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:03.060
<b>...Shoot</b>

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.710
Lt. Vita!

00:19:22.710 --> 00:19:24.350
Teana, you stupid idiot!

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:27.010
You were reckless and almost hit an ally,
what were you thinking!?

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:33.610
Uh, Lt. Vita, we were doing a combination attack, and...

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:37.190
What’s wrong with you?
That would have been a direct hit!

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:40.870
That’s not it! It was my fault, I—

00:19:40.870 --> 00:19:42.110
Shut up, morons!

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:44.070
That’s enough.

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:45.990
I’ll do the rest myself.

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:48.910
Both of you, get your asses out of the way!

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:05.810
Is someone there?

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:07.440
This place is dangerous!

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:17.860
What’s this?

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:21.820
Galue, mission clear. Good boy.

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:25.780
Now, take it to the Doctor.

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:30.590
What was the object he wanted?

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:35.560
I don’t know. It wasn’t something
being auctioned, so probably smuggled goods.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:36.210
I see.

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.330
The battle’s almost over.

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:48.100
The front-line knights fought quite well.

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:55.900
Well then, let’s continue searching for what you were looking for.

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:02.240
Sorry to have kept you waiting, the auction will begin shortly.

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:10.480
Thanks to the front-line troops, the Gadgets were all intercepted,

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:13.170
but unfortunately, we couldn’t chase after the summoner.

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:17.940
There haven’t been any injuries to our members,
and the mission itself was a success.

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:19.160
I’d say job well done.

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:22.870
I have sent an inquiry to nearby observation units.

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:26.050
I think we’ll at least be able to find their transportation route.

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:31.760
Young lady over there,

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:33.530
the auction has already started, you know.

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:38.150
Are you sure you don’t need to go inside?

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:41.100
Thank you for your kindness.

00:21:41.100 --> 00:21:44.070
But unfortunately, I’m actually here as a part of my work.

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:50.330
Unlike a certain casual Inspector, I’m pretty busy.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:22:02.380
Did you ditch your work and go playing around again, Inspector Acous?

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:06.340
How mean! I’m also in the middle of work, Hayate.

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:11.440
Now then, for an expert opinion and analysis on the items,

00:22:11.440 --> 00:22:14.870
I’d like to introduce our young archaeologist.

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:24.160
A native Midchildan scholar and Chief Librarian of the Infinity Library,

00:22:24.160 --> 00:22:25.780
Dr. Yuuno Scrya!

00:22:28.240 --> 00:22:29.670
Thank you and good afternoon.

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:31.970
Yuuno!

00:22:34.170 --> 00:22:36.540
Finally, they’re all destroyed.

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:40.460
Same here. We couldn’t find the summoner though.

00:22:40.460 --> 00:22:43.880
However, now that we know they’re there,
we can devise countermeasures.

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:44.980
True.

00:22:46.370 --> 00:22:47.340
Do you know where Teana is?

00:22:47.340 --> 00:22:49.790
Yes, ma’am. She’s guarding the back of the building.

00:22:49.790 --> 00:22:51.760
Subaru’s with her.

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:57.760
Tia, it seems everything’s over on the other side.

00:22:57.760 --> 00:23:01.650
I’ll stay on guard here. You go on ahead.

00:23:01.650 --> 00:23:04.070
You know, Tia...

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:06.030
It’s okay, go on.

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:10.370
Tia, that wasn’t your fault at all!
If I’d been paying more—

00:23:10.370 --> 00:23:11.700
Didn’t I tell you to go!?

00:23:15.200 --> 00:23:18.730
Sorry. I’ll see you later then, Tia.

00:23:24.080 --> 00:23:27.990
I... I...

00:25:17.280 --> 00:25:19.320
Regret and sadness
can be turned into

00:25:19.320 --> 00:25:21.540
the power to stand up.

00:25:21.540 --> 00:25:24.650
We had always walked together like that.

00:25:32.100 --> 00:25:34.610
Because I’m Tia’s partner!
